      {
        "heading": "Create a consistent sports collection",
        "paragraph": "Use brand colors, logo position and matching packaging to connect models without forcing every bottle into one design. For retail, consider how product photos show the cap mechanism and size. For promotional events, keep artwork clear and packaging simple. For gym distributors, lid convenience, repeat stocking and replacement-part handling may outweigh elaborate decoration."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Pilot and validate before scaling",
        "paragraph": "Order representative samples and check comfortable grip, cleaning, closure performance, artwork appearance and carton durability. Agree on MOQ by color and logo and assess shipping volume. Record the exact approved material and lid configuration. A smaller tested assortment gives more reliable insight for the next reorder than a large speculative launch."
      }
